<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine financial,stock markets reopen.</title>
<headline>Philippine financial,stock markets reopen.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in the Philippines' equity and financial markets will resume on Tuesday after closing on Monday because of torrential rains, officials said.</p>
<p>The Philippine Stock Exchange (PSE) said trading will start at 9:30 a.m. (0130 GMT) as scheduled.</p>
<p>Money and foreign exchange markets are also back to normal.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (63 2) 8418939 Fax 8176267</p>
